      "body": "Fix all three GPT-OSS attention sink loading paths: `_load_weights_mxfp4`, `_load_weights_quark`, and `_load_weights_other`. Each path now obtains the parameter's current loader through the existing `_get_weight_loader` helper and passes it the local sink slice.\r\r\n\r\r\nThe MXFP4 path also records the sink in `loaded_params`. This PR changes only `gpt_oss.py`.\r\r\n\r\r\n## Validation\r\r\n\r\r\n- `ruff check`, `ruff format --check`, and `git diff --check` pass.\r\r\n- The integrated static audit finds no direct checkpoint sink copy. The new runtime tests have not been executed, as requested.\r\r\n\r\r\n## AI assistance\r\r\n\r\r\nAI assistance was used.\r\r\n",
